- **G2-TIMED.** `GProgram.G2.ActualTimedAllPanelLaw.actual_natural_complete_timed_all_panel_projectivity` and its controlled counterpart are checked. Their actual original-calendar readouts retain the once-drawn register, fixed-ID controls and complete timed pruning for all panels, including empty/singleton panels. They do not state an arbitrary stopping-time or algorithm-termination theorem. Source `05ca8311eb01110a0d01d1f12ef6fe744fef51b21f1c3592e90bad3b08f6c376`.
- **G5-BINARY-M3.** `GProgram.G5.M3NormalizedClusterSplitIdentification.m3_identifies_documented_full_cluster_split_unions` is checked for binary temporal child-bridge sources, positive source-specific rates/interior probabilities, contemporaneous tips and at least three taxa, from ordinary original-tip triple laws. The conclusion is the full documented cluster UNION and nontrivial split UNION. It is not the co-occurrence family of displayed trees. The categorical higher-indegree HG assembly remains separate. Source `a925841c3168d979272922c39653b30304aab14e901cca4faea14cea41886416`.
- **G3-GLOBAL.** Actual fixed-positive-r strict critical-set finiteness is checked, including source certificate binding. The all-real full-presentation finiteness argument, nonlinear local classifiers and finite source lifts retain their accepted hand scopes. The new cell smoothness is now checked inside1581; finite-word log composition is a separate statically reviewed uncompiled draft. Neither finite cardinality nor smoothness acquires exact presentations or provides terminating NO coverage for arbitrary rational/algebraic input and all finite alternative sources. The checked `WholeFibreProvider` consumer still requires the source-faithful coverage and analytic certificates it consumes.
- **G4-GLOBAL.** The checked two-root stopping theorem assumes an all-rival envelope and arbitrarily-small bound. The full unknown-size target-derived forcing problem remains open. New initialized below-meeting support and literal partial-exit separation are checked under their explicit `RouteMeetingGeometry` premise. Fixed-bank comb moments and harmonic completion are older hand/source mathematics, not new discoveries. Their nonroot co-located suffix/source-law Lean composition, followed by calibration-to-geometry, remains the next source binding in the inspected path. The one-child hybrid variant cannot simply instantiate a record requiring two distinct meeting children.
- **G6-MASTER.** Strict affine elimination, finite natural-cell feasibility, original calendar/coefficient/joint-bin providers and specific forest erasure consumers are reusable checked components. The [accepted nonplanar finite-certification proof](https://github.com/Sodelin/Research-Commons/blob/539c814ac470fde8147b0e1e6d5307972585b6f8/research/2026-10-01-sol61-head-audit-1956z/G6-NONPLANAR-FINITE-CERTIFICATION.md) remains the governing hand theorem. Formal assembly must still construct positive full-forest representative compression, legal protected cuts, contextual TV and target/bin transport, both cloud directions and exact emptiness, then the confidence/robust-fibre consumer. Abstract affine feasibility alone is not source-image membership.
- **G7-POLICY-MASTER.** Exact finite-registry admission/census, original natural/controlled completed-calendar polynomial laws, executable coefficient support and actual-family rank/resource semantics are checked. Their statements preserve actual original IDs, one shared bank and the legal finite observation/trajectory contract. The effective producer still requires exact admitted-family syntax, cofacial admission where required, history-relative effective QE/action/lower-witness selection and Pareto/policy construction. A semantic finite-horizon theorem is not the executable policy selector. General native state/history/representation refinement also remains separate from finite fixture comparisons.

