## Recommended assembly order

Restore the two omitted checked bodies and retain isolated fixture execution. Then check the exact no-geometry COMMON selector and assemble the inherited fixed-bank topology moments through the actual co-located suffix before constructing calibrated geometry. Reuse the existing G1/G2/G5/G6/G7 providers at their exact premises. Keep G3 input-only acquisition and general G4 forcing explicitly open while formalizing their accepted reusable hand results. Do not use a fresh abstract theorem schema whose fields assume the missing source conclusion.

The existing65 IDs should receive dated observations and exact replacement/provider links, not a blanket status rewrite. This review neither reconstructs every historical body nor certifies that1581 contains all prior work; the recovered omissions are concrete evidence why that inference would fail.
